# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build context for the production image.
#
# The Dockerfile runs `COPY . /usr/share/nginx/html/`, so anything not listed
# here is both baked into the image AND downloadable from the web root.
#
# REQUIRED at runtime (deliberately kept):
#   Engine-V1/ Engine-V2/ shared/ index.html api_server.py nginx.conf
#   shared/decks/**            -> all deck art, served / fetched per deck
#   docs/card-details.json     -> fetched by modules/card-creator/card_creator.js
#   docs/rules.pdf             -> linked from the Player header
#   LICENSE NOTICE             -> attribution for this GPL-3.0 project
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Git / VCS ---
.git
.gitignore
dockerupload.gitignore

# --- Docker files (not needed inside the image) ---
# docker-compose.dev.yml carries a real provider API key; excluding it here
# stops it being baked into the image and served from the web root.
docker-compose.yml
docker-compose.dev.yml
.dockerignore
Dockerfile

# --- Markdown docs (never served) ---
*.md
HowTo-*.md
ChangeLog.md

# --- Screenshots and README example art ---
Screenshots/
shared/example-*.png
B-B-Shuffle-UnRaid-Template.xml

# --- Design prototypes / reference files (not part of the app) ---
# CSS_Design_* are gitignored layout experiments. floating-action-btn.html is
# the reference the site-navigation FAB (shared/js/fab.js) was adapted from.
CSS_Design_06/
CSS_Design_10/
floating-action-btn.html

# --- Local runtime data (11.9 MB) ---
# Volume-mounted at /usr/share/nginx/html/data by docker-compose, and the API
# server recreates the directory tree on startup, so the local copy must never
# be baked into the image.
data/

# --- Tooling / build inputs (not used at runtime) ---
scripts/
docs/build_card_details.py
docs/card-detection.json
docs/detection/
.trivy/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# --- Setup scripts / archived legacy launchers ---
Setup.sh
Setup.Sh
start_quick_localserver.py
start.py
archive/

# --- Logs ---
*.log
bb-shuffle-api.log

# --- OS generated files ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Editor files ---
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo

# --- Temporary files ---
*.tmp
*.temp

# --- Development files ---
node_modules/

# --- Large image sources ---
*.psd

# Engine-V1 is intentionally kept (linked from the portal for comparison).
# Engine-V1/
